server: the app opens no network socket of its own, and that is checked on every
build rather than asserted. See `scripts/audit-network.sh` in the repository, and
run it against the copy you downloaded if you would rather not take our word.

Two consequences follow, and they are stated here rather than discovered:

  (a) There is no way to deactivate a key remotely. If a key is revoked under
